      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789335942175,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "we an use deterministic filtering \nThe first layer should be pure code.\nFor example:\nDeadline\nif tender.deadline < today:\n    reject()\n\nGeography\nif tender.country not in\nTARGET_COUNTRIES:\n    reject()\n\nContract type\nif tender.type not in ALLOWED_TYPES:\n    reject()",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "iHOAU5wRAq0my8TxMtA7G",
      "originalText": "we an use deterministic filtering \nThe first layer should be pure code.\nFor example:\nDeadline\nif tender.deadline < today:\n    reject()\n\nGeography\nif tender.country not in TARGET_COUNTRIES:\n    reject()\n\nContract type\nif tender.type not in ALLOWED_TYPES:\n    reject()",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
